// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// A thing on a pedestal; lift it and the walls crack open on niches full
// of vermin: the step onto the "cracked tile" before it is the lifting,
// and `Hatch` is the vermin.
(
    name: "The Rat Trap",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "#######",
        "#.....#",
        "#..T..#",
        "#..P..#",
        "###E###",
    ],
    legend: {
        '#': Tile("hall wall"),
        '.': Tile("hall floor"),
        'T': Prop("cracked tile"),
        'P': Item(tag: "weapon", count: 1),
        'E': Entry,
    },
)
